WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.349 --> 00:00:03.099
(soothing music)

00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:34.550
(upbeat music)

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:36.500
- [Narrator] Deep in
the Himalayan Mountains,

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.750
about 80 miles outside of Katmandu,

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.830
the Bhujung Village takes part
in a death-defying tradition.

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:46.043
All in the name of honey.

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:01.670
- [Narrator] But procuring
this precious honey

00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:03.980
takes more than just strength.

00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:07.520
A team of honey hunters assembles
twice a year to prepare.

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:09.670
And Madan, he leads the pack.

00:01:24.033 --> 00:01:25.307
(birds singing)

00:01:25.307 --> 00:01:28.750
(chatting in foreign language)

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:29.690
- [Narrator] Today,

00:01:29.690 --> 00:01:32.930
ancient customs are
still closely followed.

00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:36.060
Before each hunt, Madan
must visit the village guru

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:37.404
to receive his blessing.

00:01:37.404 --> 00:01:41.321
(chanting in foreign language)

00:01:52.331 --> 00:01:54.856
(gentle music)

00:01:54.856 --> 00:01:57.480
- [Narrator] One day, Madan
will fill the guru's shoes.

00:01:57.480 --> 00:02:00.370
In the meantime, he leads
his team of honey hunters

00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:01.858
into the jungle.

00:02:01.858 --> 00:02:05.420
(energizing music)

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:09.290
The team braids and re-secures
their handmade rope ladders.

00:02:09.290 --> 00:02:11.420
Then, they venture to the cliffside

00:02:11.420 --> 00:02:13.253
where the beehives are hiding.

00:02:14.910 --> 00:02:17.380
The team creates smoke fires down below

00:02:17.380 --> 00:02:20.220
to encourage the giant bees to scatter.

00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:22.750
Madan lowers himself onto the rope,

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:25.630
dangling hundreds of feet from the ground.

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:50.140
- [Narrator] Despite
the incessant stinging

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:54.350
on his unprotected skin, he
calmly cuts away at the hive,

00:02:54.350 --> 00:02:57.643
fulfilling his duty and
securing his liquid gold.

00:03:08.662 --> 00:03:11.245
(gentle music)

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:14.170
- [Narrator] The hives are
collected by the hunters

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:16.420
and packed up to bring back to the village

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:18.683
where their safe return is celebrated.

00:03:47.138 --> 00:03:49.971
(low chime rings)

